criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
fixed restoration and dentition including the second molar
Exclusion criteria:
Suspected TMD; 
severe deep bite preventing the attachment of the paraocclusal fork of the axiography system;
lack of patient consent; patients with dementia or other cognitive impairments who are unable to provide informed consent for the study; 
pregnancy/breastfeeding; 
patients who do not agree to participate in the study for other reasons.
